Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.79,0:00:21.53,HybridMain,H,0000,0000,0000,,No... Not there...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.11,0:00:39.93,HybridMain,Y,0000,0000,0000,,Hurry up and climax already, jeez.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.02,0:00:47.56,HybridMain,H,0000,0000,0000,,N-No, Kizuna-kun, that's my...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.07,0:00:58.20,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,I guess this is the right spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.48,0:01:00.67,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,But, you know,\Nyou sure are sensitive, Himekawa.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.67,0:01:02.78,HybridMain,H,0000,0000,0000,,Th-That's not true!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.78,0:01:05.71,HybridMain,H,0000,0000,0000,,I-I'm just doing this because \Nit's part of our mission!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.17,0:01:14.46,HybridItalics,K,0000,0000,0000,,I'll finish it now!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.28,0:01:24.62,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Take this!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.09,0:01:30.61,HybridMain,H,0000,0000,0000,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.48,0:01:35.53,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.53,0:01:37.32,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Heart Hybrid successful!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.32,0:01:38.86,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Charging is complete, Himekawa!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.64,0:01:57.40,HybridMain,Y,0000,0000,0000,,You're finally out.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.04,0:02:00.12,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Yurishia!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.12,0:02:03.98,HybridMain,Y,0000,0000,0000,,Your Heart Hybrid always \Ntakes so long, Hayuru.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.98,0:02:06.52,HybridMain,Y,0000,0000,0000,,Well, you were having a good time, I suppose.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.78,0:02:08.44,HybridMain,H,0000,0000,0000,,Th-That's crass slander!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.44,0:02:10.80,HybridMain,H,0000,0000,0000,,I would never do something \Nas perverted as this...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.80,0:02:13.73,HybridMain,,0000,0000,0000,,...b-because I wanted to!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.03,0:02:16.03,HybridMain,Y,0000,0000,0000,,Okay, okay. I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.03,0:02:18.36,HybridMain,Y,0000,0000,0000,,Anyway, now that you've recharged,\Nget to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.36,0:02:19.36,HybridMain,H,0000,0000,0000,,Of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.16,0:02:21.16,HybridMain,H,0000,0000,0000,,Neros!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.56,0:02:23.12,HybridMain,H,0000,0000,0000,,See you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.08,0:02:41.96,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Aine!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.45,0:02:47.26,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Aine?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.79,0:02:52.17,HybridItalics,H,0000,0000,0000,,A-Aine-san?\NWhat do you think you're doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.17,0:02:54.11,HybridItalics,Y,0000,0000,0000,,It's supposed to be my turn next!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.11,0:02:55.15,HybridItalics,Y,0000,0000,0000,,No fair, Aine!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.15,0:02:56.86,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,Talk about an annoying crowd.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.86,0:02:57.68,HybridMain,Both,0000,0000,0000,,Wha—
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.16,0:02:59.03,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Aine?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.21,0:03:04.99,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,Kizuna, do it with me right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.36,0:03:09.79,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Huh? But your Hybrid Count is still high.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.36,0:03:13.60,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,To change the course of \Nthis battle, I want...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.60,0:03:14.80,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,...the forbidden weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.80,0:03:15.75,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,But that's...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.15,0:03:17.96,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,Don't worry, Kizuna.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.96,0:03:19.39,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,I am who I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.39,0:03:21.51,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,No matter what happens, that won't change.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.69,0:03:24.22,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,So do it with me...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.90,0:03:26.97,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,Let's Climax Hybrid.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.15,0:05:02.11,Episode,A,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(460,460)}Episode One
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.15,0:05:02.11,Title,A,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(460,460)}Strategic Defense Academy Ataraxia
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.27,0:05:02.22,HybridFlashback,K,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}W-Wait, Mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.64,0:05:08.09,HybridFlashback,N,0000,0000,0000,,Goodbye, Kizuna.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.09,0:05:11.29,HybridFlashback,N,0000,0000,0000,,You're not needed anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.95,0:05:19.20,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,If I'm having a dream like that,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.20,0:05:21.44,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,I must be nervous after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.34,0:05:25.41,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Seriously, what is Sis planning?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.41,0:05:26.41,HybridItalics,R,0000,0000,0000,,Dear Kizuna,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.41,0:05:28.92,HybridItalics,R,0000,0000,0000,,I filled out all the paperwork \Nfor you to attend Ataraxia.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.92,0:05:30.41,HybridItalics,R,0000,0000,0000,,Come to Ataraxia immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.41,0:05:33.26,HybridItalics,R,0000,0000,0000,,Report to HQ at noon tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.26,0:05:33.87,HybridItalics,R,0000,0000,0000,,Reiri.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.63,0:05:37.21,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,I hear from her after ages,\Nand that's all she says?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.21,0:05:39.56,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Though, well, I came anyway,\Nso I'm one to talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.56,0:05:41.32,Atraxia,K,0000,0000,0000,,To Ataraxia
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.56,0:05:43.16,HybridItalics,Gu,0000,0000,0000,,Arriving at Ataraxia now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.16,0:05:46.94,HybridItalics,Gu,0000,0000,0000,,Please have your ID ready \Nfor the border crossing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.94,0:05:50.41,HybridItalics,Gu,0000,0000,0000,,Welcome to Ataraxia.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.19,0:06:14.38,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,So this is the integrated research facility
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.38,0:06:18.43,HybridMain,,0000,0000,0000,,that's been training people and doing R&D\Nto fight the otherworld invasion,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.43,0:06:20.96,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Strategic Defense Academy Ataraxia.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.89,0:06:23.02,HybridMain,Gu,0000,0000,0000,,Are you a transfer student?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.68,0:06:24.76,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,Hello there!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.52,0:06:32.09,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,That's Yurishia-sama for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.09,0:06:33.12,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,You can say that again.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.69,0:06:35.87,HybridMain,H,0000,0000,0000,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.28,0:06:37.93,HybridMain,H,0000,0000,0000,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.93,0:06:41.38,HybridMain,H,0000,0000,0000,,I can't ignore something so lewd!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.38,0:06:42.73,HybridMain,H,0000,0000,0000,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.73,0:06:45.37,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,So I'm going to be living here now?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.37,0:06:47.24,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,It doesn't seem real...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.38,0:06:53.19,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,The guy who just ran by\N must've dropped this.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.53,0:06:57.92,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,H-Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.92,0:07:00.20,HybridItalics,R,0000,0000,0000,,Kizuna, did you make it here okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.20,0:07:01.20,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Sis!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.20,0:07:02.49,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, just now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.49,0:07:07.01,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,But is it really okay\Nfor me to come to Ataraxia?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.01,0:07:09.34,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,My grades aren't that great,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.34,0:07:12.16,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,and I was already kicked out of here once.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.16,0:07:14.03,HybridMain,R,0000,0000,0000,,I don't want to hear your excuses!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.32,0:07:15.53,HybridMain,R,0000,0000,0000,,I need you,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.84,0:07:18.29,HybridMain,,0000,0000,0000,,and your Heart Hybrid Gear.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.36,0:07:21.10,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.10,0:07:23.54,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,It's not going to be useful for anything now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.54,0:07:26.55,HybridItalics,R,0000,0000,0000,,Shut up and get your ass to HQ, Kizuna Hida!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.84,0:07:29.04,HybridItalics,R,0000,0000,0000,,I always get what I want!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.04,0:07:31.17,HybridItalics,R,0000,0000,0000,,And I want that thing that was\Ninstalled in you, the Er—
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.17,0:07:31.80,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,I-I'm coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.05,0:07:35.18,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,I'm on my way,\Nso please don't say another word!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.58,0:07:44.32,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,I'm lost...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.25,0:07:47.65,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Wh-Where is HQ?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.96,0:08:19.16,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.16,0:08:20.77,HybridMain,,0000,0000,0000,,U-Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.12,0:08:23.82,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,Do you lack the intelligence \Nrequired to understand language?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.82,0:08:25.48,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,I've never seen a creature like you before.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.39,0:08:33.12,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Uh, I'm Kizuna Hida.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.12,0:08:36.27,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,From now on, I'll be going \Nto the high school here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.27,0:08:37.91,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,You're a student here, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.16,0:08:39.95,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,What else could I be?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.95,0:08:43.48,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,Do you think I'm a weirdo who got a \Nuniform and snuck through security,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.48,0:08:45.67,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,just so I could look at the scenery?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.42,0:08:48.64,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,You don't need to be so touchy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.64,0:08:49.61,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,Touchy?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.61,0:08:52.94,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,Why would I waste my time \Nbeing touchy with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.94,0:08:56.18,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,It would make more sense for you \Nto get on your knees and beg me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.18,0:08:59.47,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,To let you kiss my feet.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.47,0:09:00.73,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,I'm not gonna beg for that!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.73,0:09:03.64,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,You're lying, you inferior creature.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.64,0:09:05.37,HybridItalics,K,0000,0000,0000,,What's with this girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.37,0:09:08.40,HybridItalics,K,0000,0000,0000,,She's hot as hell,\Nbut her personality's not so swell.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.72,0:09:11.58,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,I'm Aine Chidorigafuchi, from Class 2-A.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.58,0:09:12.97,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,Now worship me!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.97,0:09:14.15,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Hell no!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.41,0:09:15.43,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Sheesh...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.95,0:09:20.53,HybridMain,H,0000,0000,0000,,An air-raid siren?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.85,0:09:24.01,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,An air raid?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.01,0:09:26.20,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,This place is supposed \Nto be in the safe zone.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.20,0:09:28.60,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Their ships shouldn't be \Nable to travel this far.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.60,0:09:30.30,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,This is Ataraxia.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.30,0:09:31.85,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,There'd never be a false alarm here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.85,0:09:34.08,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,The enemy really has appeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.08,0:09:34.75,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,The enemy...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.75,0:09:36.55,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,You need to run.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.85,0:09:40.97,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,W-Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.97,0:09:42.25,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.25,0:09:44.06,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,What is someone sees you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.35,0:09:46.19,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,The only one watching is you!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.19,0:09:48.81,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,I told you to run, you lecher.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.20,0:09:53.02,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Y-You're the one who started stripping,\Nyou exhibitionist.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.02,0:09:56.43,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,Just look away. That way,\Nthere won't be a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.43,0:09:59.48,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,Right now, I'm a poor victim,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.48,0:10:01.21,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,and you're a perverted Peeping Tom.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.21,0:10:03.21,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Who are you calling a pervert?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.90,0:10:06.69,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,A pilot suit?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.69,0:10:08.25,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,You can't be...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.35,0:10:10.25,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,Zeros!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.28,0:10:44.28,HybridItalics,K,0000,0000,0000,,A Heart Hybrid Gear!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.82,0:10:47.55,HybridItalics,K,0000,0000,0000,,She has a core installed, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.55,0:10:48.97,HybridItalics,Sh,0000,0000,0000,,Aine Chidorigafuchi,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.97,0:10:51.71,HybridItalics,Sh,0000,0000,0000,,your Heart Hybrid Gear \Nhas little charge left.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.71,0:10:53.94,HybridItalics,Sh,0000,0000,0000,,You can't fight for long.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.98,0:10:57.10,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,You don't have to spell out the obvious.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.55,0:11:04.01,HybridItalics,K,0000,0000,0000,,A Magitech weapon?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.44,0:11:07.48,HybridItalics,K,0000,0000,0000,,I should go, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.28,0:11:13.77,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,What's all that stuff doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.88,0:11:21.31,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,I guess normal weapons \Nwouldn't work after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.35,0:11:30.16,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Sh-She hit it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.08,0:11:36.97,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,What an absurd fighting style.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.04,0:11:46.98,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,There's an interception system here, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.33,0:12:12.57,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.57,0:12:15.50,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,You just defeated a Magitech with\Na normal weapon and your bare hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.32,0:12:18.33,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,These things are everywhere?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.33,0:12:19.55,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.55,0:12:21.88,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,We never know when the enemy will attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.88,0:12:26.97,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,And fighting Magitech weapons\N is Amaterasu's mission!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.36,0:12:28.76,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Amaterasu...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.51,0:12:37.39,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,They never learn.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.39,0:12:38.76,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Evacuate quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.76,0:12:40.26,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,If you don't, you'll die.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.32,0:12:45.08,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Shouldn't I fight, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.08,0:12:46.87,HybridFlashback,N,0000,0000,0000,,You're not needed anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.88,0:12:51.00,HybridFlashback,N,0000,0000,0000,,Hard work means nothing\Nwithout the talent to back it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.00,0:12:54.29,HybridFlashback,N,0000,0000,0000,,Talent can be honed, but if there's nothing\Nto hone in the first place...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.92,0:12:56.34,HybridFlashback,N,0000,0000,0000,,There's nothing that can be done.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.98,0:13:00.21,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Sure,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.63,0:13:03.80,HybridMain,,0000,0000,0000,,my Heart Hybrid Gear has very little power.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.80,0:13:07.55,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,But if I equip it, maybe I can do something.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.00,0:13:10.73,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Er... Er... Er...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.73,0:13:11.55,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,I can't do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.55,0:13:14.36,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,I can't say that name!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.07,0:13:25.32,HybridMain,H,0000,0000,0000,,Blade!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.01,0:13:33.82,HybridMain,H,0000,0000,0000,,What's an off-campus student doing here?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.82,0:13:35.58,HybridMain,H,0000,0000,0000,,This is an emergency!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.05,0:13:37.93,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,You have a Hybrid Gear, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.59,0:13:50.35,HybridMain,Y,0000,0000,0000,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.82,0:13:52.94,HybridMain,Y,0000,0000,0000,,We'll be in trouble if we all don't fight,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.94,0:13:54.41,HybridMain,Y,0000,0000,0000,,so could you please not slack off?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.41,0:13:57.35,HybridMain,Y,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, is that your boyfriend?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.35,0:13:59.98,HybridMain,H,0000,0000,0000,,H-H-He couldn't possibly be my boyfriend!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.98,0:14:01.42,HybridMain,H,0000,0000,0000,,How lewd!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.42,0:14:04.61,HybridMain,H,0000,0000,0000,,We have a more important, more noble goal!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.88,0:14:06.54,HybridMain,Y,0000,0000,0000,,Okay, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.54,0:14:09.71,HybridMain,Y,0000,0000,0000,,Let's go take out the descending\NMagitech weapons, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.71,0:14:12.68,HybridMain,Y,0000,0000,0000,,If we don't hurry,\N Ataraxia will be wiped out.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.68,0:14:13.95,HybridMain,H,0000,0000,0000,,I know that!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.95,0:14:15.98,HybridMain,H,0000,0000,0000,,You get to a shelter immediately!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.98,0:14:17.02,HybridMain,H,0000,0000,0000,,Understood?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.25,0:14:21.69,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Those girls are fighting,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.69,0:14:22.62,HybridMain,,0000,0000,0000,,and I'm...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.60,0:14:46.23,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,I can handle that, too...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.82,0:14:50.49,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,My Hybrid Count...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.99,0:14:55.91,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,What's happened to her?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.02,0:15:10.18,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,A-Are you serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.72,0:15:11.68,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,What do I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.68,0:15:13.10,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,What do I do? What do I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.80,0:15:14.93,HybridFlashback,R,0000,0000,0000,,Listen, Kizuna.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.31,0:15:18.46,HybridFlashback,R,0000,0000,0000,,A person's value isn't \Ndecided by their abilities.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.90,0:15:20.73,HybridFlashback,R,0000,0000,0000,,It's decided by how they live.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.11,0:15:22.10,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Sis!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.11,0:15:34.68,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Eros!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.38,0:15:44.00,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Make it in time!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.23,0:15:54.68,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Ow...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.68,0:15:57.99,HybridMain,,0000,0000,0000,,Sure, it may be useless junk,\Nbut how can it be this weak?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.26,0:16:08.51,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, Chidorigafuchi!\NPull yourself together!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.51,0:16:09.53,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.53,0:16:11.56,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Damn it! What do I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.56,0:16:12.82,HybridItalics,R,0000,0000,0000,,Kizuna, can you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.08,0:16:15.20,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Sis! Is that you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.20,0:16:16.41,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Good, I'm in a bad—
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.41,0:16:17.48,HybridItalics,R,0000,0000,0000,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.48,0:16:19.29,HybridItalics,R,0000,0000,0000,,I know your situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.62,0:16:23.29,HybridItalics,R,0000,0000,0000,,If you want to save Aine, do as I say.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.88,0:16:25.88,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Fine. What should I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.88,0:16:28.35,HybridItalics,R,0000,0000,0000,,First, fondle Aine's breasts.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.35,0:16:29.05,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.05,0:16:35.55,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,What are you making me do?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.13,0:16:38.70,HybridItalics,R,0000,0000,0000,,Be gentler.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.70,0:16:40.44,HybridItalics,R,0000,0000,0000,,Fondle them like crazy, but gently.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.44,0:16:41.37,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,No, I mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.37,0:16:44.40,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Why am I fondling a girl I just met?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.40,0:16:46.06,HybridItalics,R,0000,0000,0000,,Don't think! Feel!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.06,0:16:47.74,HybridItalics,R,0000,0000,0000,,Feel her heart and body.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.74,0:16:49.55,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Her heart and body?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.55,0:16:52.14,HybridItalics,R,0000,0000,0000,,If you can't do that, both of you will die.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.92,0:16:56.16,HybridItalics,R,0000,0000,0000,,If you want to get out of this situation \Nand save Aine, it's the only way!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.16,0:16:58.54,HybridItalics,R,0000,0000,0000,,Only you can do this, Kizuna!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.54,0:17:00.10,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Only me?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.86,0:17:03.39,HybridItalics,R,0000,0000,0000,,Then think of it this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.39,0:17:05.95,HybridItalics,R,0000,0000,0000,,Check her body for wounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.95,0:17:07.40,HybridItalics,R,0000,0000,0000,,Every nook and cranny.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.40,0:17:09.59,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,O-Okay. I can do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.45,0:17:15.87,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Chidorigafuchi?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.87,0:17:17.63,HybridItalics,R,0000,0000,0000,,Just keep going!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.63,0:17:19.47,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,O-Okay. Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.72,0:17:34.57,HybridItalics,K,0000,0000,0000,,I-I never knew a girl's body was so soft.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.57,0:17:36.11,HybridItalics,R,0000,0000,0000,,Now spread her legs.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.11,0:17:38.51,HybridItalics,R,0000,0000,0000,,Get in between them and look. Carefully.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.51,0:17:39.37,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.21,0:17:49.04,HybridItalics,K,0000,0000,0000,,It really just seems like \NI'm feeling this girl up...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.04,0:17:49.63,HybridItalics,K,0000,0000,0000,,And...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.56,0:17:56.63,HybridItalics,K,0000,0000,0000,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.74,0:18:03.01,HybridItalics,K,0000,0000,0000,,I-It's digging in so deep.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.99,0:18:06.44,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,What was that shaking?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.44,0:18:07.79,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Did a cannon hit?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.79,0:18:09.58,HybridItalics,R,0000,0000,0000,,Hurry! There's no time!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.58,0:18:22.24,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,I nearly chocked...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.24,0:18:24.46,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,...to death...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.44,0:18:34.42,HybridItalics,K,0000,0000,0000,,Is this the light of her Heart Hybrid Gear?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.72,0:18:42.93,HybridItalics,K,0000,0000,0000,,She's so cute...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.44,0:18:46.68,HybridMain,R,0000,0000,0000,,Now, Kizuna! Feel up her breasts!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.60,0:18:53.53,HybridItalics,R,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.94,0:18:55.55,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,I'm doing what you said...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.55,0:18:57.10,HybridItalics,R,0000,0000,0000,,Harder!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.73,0:18:59.36,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,But that's not...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.36,0:19:01.70,HybridItalics,R,0000,0000,0000,,Just do it now, and do it hard!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.31,0:19:13.21,HybridItalics,R,0000,0000,0000,,Success!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.56,0:19:15.00,HybridItalics,R,0000,0000,0000,,Well done, Kizuna!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.00,0:19:16.91,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,S-Success?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.91,0:19:19.22,HybridItalics,K,0000,0000,0000,,The Heart Hybrid was a success!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.48,0:19:21.95,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Heart Hybrid?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.95,0:19:23.80,HybridItalics,R,0000,0000,0000,,A mixing of heart and love.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.80,0:19:26.72,HybridItalics,R,0000,0000,0000,,That is the true power \Nof the Heart Hybrid Gear!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.28,0:19:28.25,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.25,0:19:29.96,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, Chidorigafuchi!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.03,0:19:45.86,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,What did you do while I was unconscious?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.69,0:19:50.30,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,I feel so light.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.89,0:19:54.82,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,No way. My Hybrid Count...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.67,0:19:57.85,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,It was almost zero.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.85,0:19:58.86,HybridItalics,R,0000,0000,0000,,Aine!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.86,0:20:00.76,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,Commander! What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.60,0:20:05.72,HybridItalics,R,0000,0000,0000,,I'll explain later. Can you fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.72,0:20:06.65,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.65,0:20:07.60,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,Zeros!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.57,0:20:10.81,HybridItalics,A,0000,0000,0000,,This power...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.67,0:20:12.66,HybridItalics,A,0000,0000,0000,,I can do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.10,0:20:21.28,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Chidorigafuchi?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.84,0:20:36.34,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,She's crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.16,0:20:39.30,HybridMain,Y,0000,0000,0000,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.30,0:20:40.86,HybridMain,Y,0000,0000,0000,,That's amazing, Aine!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.86,0:20:42.96,HybridMain,Y,0000,0000,0000,,You defeated that huge army.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.96,0:20:44.27,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,Yurishia! Hayuru!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.27,0:20:45.60,HybridMain,,0000,0000,0000,,Where's the enemy carrier?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.50,0:20:47.71,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,Retreating...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.71,0:20:48.44,HybridMain,H,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.31,0:20:52.22,HybridMain,H,0000,0000,0000,,But we destroyed most of the \Nenemy Magitech weapons,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.22,0:20:53.42,HybridMain,H,0000,0000,0000,,so let's be content with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.42,0:20:54.94,HybridMain,Y,0000,0000,0000,,But what happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.57,0:20:58.18,HybridMain,Y,0000,0000,0000,,Aine was like a totally \Ndifferent person just now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.36,0:21:01.16,HybridMain,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.16,0:21:02.19,HybridMain,H,0000,0000,0000,,Is that...?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.74,0:21:05.76,HybridItalics,A,0000,0000,0000,,Who...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.77,0:21:07.95,HybridItalics,,0000,0000,0000,,...are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.39,0:21:13.33,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.98,0:21:28.14,HybridMain,R,0000,0000,0000,,For now,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.61,0:21:30.85,HybridMain,,0000,0000,0000,,we've made it through the first stage.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.07,0:21:36.32,HybridMain,R,0000,0000,0000,,The mission is only just beginning,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.32,0:21:39.10,HybridMain,R,0000,0000,0000,,but the Hybrid Heart is the key...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.10,0:21:41.36,HybridMain,,0000,0000,0000,,...to the success of this mission!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.61,0:21:51.37,HybridMain,R,0000,0000,0000,,The key to retaking the mainland,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.78,0:21:53.99,HybridMain,,0000,0000,0000,,retaking the world we lost!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.04,0:23:40.06,Illustration,,0000,0000,0000,,Illustration: Kana Miyai
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.07,0:23:27.56,HybridMain,R,0000,0000,0000,,What's with him?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.56,0:23:31.23,HybridMain,R,0000,0000,0000,,How he could do that, or {\i1}that{\i0}, to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.23,0:23:34.15,HybridMain,R,0000,0000,0000,,You'll pay for this, Kizuna Hida!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.63,0:23:39.27,HybridMain,R,0000,0000,0000,,But if I can gain power that way, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.05,0:23:40.06,Next Episode Title,,0001,0001,0160,,{\fad(900,1)}Next Time: "Heart Hybrid"
